                         MMDDYYYY(DATE1)
                         TIME(TIME1)
               END-EXEC.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       REFRESH-POSTCODE-0047.
               IF WS-KEY-CUSTOMER = ZERO
                  MOVE ' NO POSTCODE' TO EM-VARIABLE
                  MOVE '01' TO WS-STATUS-CODE
               ELSE
                  MOVE '00' TO WS-STATUS-CODE
               END-IF.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       FILE-ACCESS-0048.
               EXEC CICS WRITE FILE('KSDSVA65')
